<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-21210] tests: remove obsolete sanity 17h regression test</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21210</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;tt&gt;sanity 17h&lt;/tt&gt; was introduced for bug 17378 to test the &lt;tt&gt;OBD_FAIL_MDS_LOV_PREP_CREATE (0x141)&lt;/tt&gt; fault-injection path.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Commit &lt;tt&gt;03f537c50b&lt;/tt&gt; (&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-2244" title="remove obsolete code" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-2244"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-2244&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;) removed the LOV QoS code containing the corresponding &lt;tt&gt;OBD_FAIL_CHECK()&lt;/tt&gt;, but the regression test and fault-injection constant were retained.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The test still passes, but no longer exercises its intended failure path.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Remove &lt;tt&gt;sanity 17h&lt;/tt&gt; and the unused &lt;tt&gt;OBD_FAIL_MDS_LOV_PREP_CREATE&lt;/tt&gt; definition.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
